    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809120/extras/57b9cc2d516458073b25789946e3cbc4.avif?t=1730313084\" width=612 height=114 /></span><br><br>RED SNOW is the most violent snowboarding game on planet earth.<br><br>Hit the slopes with an arsenal of weapons.<br><br>Combo your way through an arctic battlefield as you flip, spin, and grind for your life.<br><br>Upgrade your weapon loadout and build your dream snowboarder-warrior.<br><br>Paint the slopes red with their blood. Welcome to RED SNOW.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809120/extras/c112b65cfced228125ac064256ce80ff.avif?t=1730313084\" width=612 height=637 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809120/extras/57b9cc2d516458073b25789946e3cbc4.avif?t=1730313084\" width=612 height=114 /></span><br><br>RED SNOW is the most violent snowboarding game on planet earth.<br><br>Hit the slopes with an arsenal of weapons.<br><br>Combo your way through an arctic battlefield as you flip, spin, and grind for your life.<br><br>Upgrade your weapon loadout and build your dream snowboarder-warrior.<br><br>Paint the slopes red with their blood. Welcome to RED SNOW.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809120/extras/c112b65cfced228125ac064256ce80ff.avif?t=1730313084\" width=612 height=637 /></span>",
