        ],
        "notes": "Red Snow is a game about violent snowboarding, where the \"violent\" aspect is dialed up to a ridiculous and often humorous degree. Despite that, Red Snow maintains a lighthearted tone, avoiding mean-spirited, edgy, or horrific elements. The game's violent aspects are presented as an amusing fantasy that we trust our audience to recognize as unreal and comedic in nature. Our sole aim is to elicit laughter and entertainment from our audience, wholeheartedly welcoming them into the experience."
